        "text_Cdb4ab": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p><strong>Each is a piece of unique jewelry shaped by hand from reclaimed materials, every fragment carrying a small history of its own before it is set in gold plated silver or sterling silver and finished into wearable art</strong>. Because the source materials are themselves one-of-a-kind, no two pieces are ever quite alike, which is what makes them such meaningful unique jewelry gifts for the people who matter most.</p><p>Founded in Detroit in 2013, Rebel Nell creates jewelry with story behind it, and the women employed as Creative Designers are the hands behind every piece. Through a workforce program that pairs employment with wraparound resources, each keepsake we make becomes both a beautiful object and a small reminder that there is power in being one of no other kind. Learn more <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/our-story\" title=\"Read our story\">about Rebel Nell</a> and <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/reviews-1\" title=\"Read customer reviews\">read our customer reviews</a>.</p>"
          }
